{"ID":"20240206115025-ol5f05z","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206115025-ol5f05z","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115025-ol5f05z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115034-dp6zs3q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115029-mxt5oo4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:296,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206115034-dp6zs3q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:136,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:136\u0026#125;","title":"荷叶","type":"doc","updated":"20240902165857"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206115034-dp6zs3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206115034-dp6zs3q","updated":"20240206115037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产福建、江苏、湖南、湖北等地。\n【性状】\t荷叶叶多折成半圆形或扇形，展开后呈类圆形，直径2050cm，全缘或稍波状。上表面深绿色或黄绿较粗糙；下表面淡灰棕色，较光滑，有粗脉2122条，处中心向四周射出，中心有突起的叶西峡钱基。质脆，易破碎。微有清香气，味微苦。\n【性味】\t苦，平。\n【功效】\t清热解暑，升发清阳，凉血止血。用于暑热烦渴，暑湿泄泻，脾虚泄泻，血热吐衄，便血崩漏。\n【炙品】\t荷叶炭：取净荷叶，照煅炭法煅成炭。能够收涩化瘀止血。用于多种出血症及产后血晕。"}]},{"ID":"20240206115029-mxt5oo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206115029-mxt5oo4","updated":"20240206115029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206115029-0ibrnuu.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161633-60h67lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161633-60h67lf","updated":"20240724161633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240724160926-oubnbhh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161633-7moqgp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161633-7moqgp2","updated":"20240724161633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621115618-6nq1xik.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 443px;","style":"width: 433px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621115625-x18qwzp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 433px;\" parent-style=\"width: 443px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 346px;","style":"width: 336px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621124313-1g6qc7s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 336px;\" parent-style=\"width: 346px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240724161633-ykptukv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240724161633-ykptukv","updated":"20240724161633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 375px;","style":"width: 365px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荷花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荷花-20240724155143-k61v7x3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKr